ComfyUI_NAIDGenerator-neo

This project began as a fork of ComfyUI_NAIDGenerator:
https://github.com/bedovyy/ComfyUI_NAIDGenerator

The Neo project uses its own node namespace, module structure, request client,
image conversion module, prompt conversion module, tests, and documentation.
